# Credentials. The Databento FTP account lives here; it must never enter git history,
# because history is not deletable in any practical sense once pushed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Data. GLBX.MDP3 extracts are large and reproducible from the vendor; the trial log is
# NOT data and IS committed (see CLAUDE_FUTURES.md §6).
#
# THE LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING. `data/` without it matches ANY directory named data at
# any depth, which silently excluded `src/futuresres/data/` - the entire data layer, the
# package that builds every series the calibrations rest on - from every commit this repo
# ever made. `/data/` anchors the rule to the repository root. decisions.md 36.
/data/
*.dbn
*.dbn.zst
*.parquet

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Discord bot runtime files (live on the droplet)
bot/state.json
bot/demo_log.csv
bot/*.tmp
bot/tickets.json
bot/shadow_log.csv
bot/last_alert.txt
# Kalshi LIP bot runtime files (never commit keys or state)
/kalshi_lip/.env
/kalshi_lip/*.pem
/kalshi_lip/state*.json
/kalshi_lip/lip_log.jsonl
/kalshi_lip/STOP
